#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:5
msgid "Folio settings"
msgstr "组合设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option to storage at the Data from the application"
" some `project properties`_ pre-defined by the user. This feature allows the"
" user avoiding to define many `project properties`_ each time that the user "
"`creates new projects`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 从应用程序中提供了从数据中存储一些 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ "
"由用户预先定义的选项。该特性允许用户每次在用户 `创建新项目 <project properties_>`_ 时避免定义许多 `项目属性 "
"<creates new projects_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:11
msgid ""
"The **Folio** tab from **New project** settings section allows pre-defining "
"some `folio properties`_:"
msgstr "**Folio** 选项卡来自 **新项目** 设置部分允许预先定义一些 `组合属性 <folio properties_>`_ :"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:13
msgid "`Folio size`_."
msgstr "`Folio大小 <Folio size_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:14
msgid "`Folio title block`_."
msgstr "`Folio 图框 <Folio title block_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:15
msgid "`Folio default variables values`_."
msgstr "`Folio 默认变量值 <Folio default variables values_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:16
msgid "`Folio user variables`_."
msgstr "`Folio 用户变量 <Folio user variables_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech New project folio settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 新的项目组合设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:23
msgid "To define folio settings:"
msgstr "要定义组合设置："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:25
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:26
msgid "Go to **New project** section."
msgstr "转到 **新项目** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:27
msgid "Go to **Folio** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Folio** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:28
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "定义每个字段的理想参数。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:29
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close settings "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改和关闭设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_settings.rst:33
msgid ""
"All pre-defined `folio properties`_ defined at QElectroTech settings PopUP "
"window will be automatically defined during `project creation`_ at `project "
"properties`_. The `folio properties`_ can be found at `Folio tab`_ from  "
"`New folio`_ section."
msgstr ""
"所有预定义 `folio 属性 <folio properties_>`_ 在 QElectroTech 设置中定义的 PopUP 窗口将在 `项目创建"
" <project creation_>`_ 时间 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 编辑 `folio 属性 <folio "
"properties_>`_ 可见于 `组合标签 <Folio tab_>`_ 从  `新组合 <New folio_>`_ 节。"
